**Closeout**: DoD items all ticked, `status: implemented`, plan record committed with the code, event logged via `event.py` bound to `74496f2`, log committed as `0c2cccf`.

One note surfaced during implementation: `handleFinal` awaits `renameSpeakers` before `appendSegment`, so back-to-back same-speaker finals can reach `appendSegment` out of order (pre-existing behavior — cue 2 could append before cue 1 even before merging). The e2e test serializes the emits to stay deterministic; out-of-order `appendSegment` calls themselves remain an upstream behavior untouched per the plan's scope.
